 tools/pack/AGENTS.md                          |  1 +
 tools/pack/README.md                          |  7 +++--
 .../resources/linux/debian/changelog.template |  2 +-
 tools/pack/src/linux.ts                       | 30 +++++++++----------
 4 files changed, 20 insertions(+), 20 deletions(-)

